<title>BELGIUM: EU clears GEC Alsthom NV buy of AEG unit -source.</title>
<headline>EU clears GEC Alsthom NV buy of AEG unit -source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared the acquisition by GEC Alsthom NV of control of AEG T&amp;D, owned by AEG, a European Union source said on Friday.</p>
<p>AEG is majority owned by Daimler-Benz.</p>
<p>GEC Alsthom NV is jointly owned by General Electric Company and Alcatel Alsthom CGE.</p>
</text>
